00:43:58,540 --> 00:44:04,260
Western farmers possess the knowledge of modern farming techniques so desperately needed by people at the Aral Sea.

563
00:44:05,140 --> 00:44:10,820
But as the Karakopaks have learned so well, Western technologies must be adopted with caution.

564
00:44:11,480 --> 00:44:17,400
I think the big lesson of the Aral Sea is you have to be very, very careful when you try to re-engineer what nature has created.

